    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. i'm so tired of fighting it every single day. you keep saying \"letting go\", but what does that actually look like? i just want the noise to stop. i want to feel like i'm not hurting anyone anymore. is there really any way to just... find peace?",
